{{!
    @template mod_oksigeniajepyso/player

    The page of the player and of the builder: a document of its own, with the app of Jepyso in it and none of the
    theme, so a phone loads only what the figure needs. Its content policy lets it load and call nothing outside the
    site. The app reads from #app who is there and in which activity (classes/output/player_page.php).

    This file comes from the repository of Jepyso (tools/moodle/player.mustache) with the player.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * lang - The language of the page, for its lang attribute
    * title - The name of the activity, or of the builder
    * base - The address of the folder of the player
    * version - The version of the plugin, so a browser never mixes two versions
    * userlang - The language of the user in Moodle
    * cmid - The course module of the activity, or empty in the builder
    * code - The code of its routine, or empty in the builder
    * sesskey, service - What the external functions of the plugin are called with, and where
    * backurl - The page of the activity, or empty
    * firstname - The first name of the person
    * cansubmit - Whether the person keeps sessions, or is only trying the routine

    Example context (json):
    {
        "lang": "en",
        "title": "Strength routine",
        "base": "https://example.com/mod/oksigeniajepyso/reproductor",
        "version": "2026112500",
        "userlang": "en",
        "cmid": "7",
        "code": "j.e30",
        "sesskey": "abcdef",
        "service": "https://example.com/lib/ajax/service.php",
        "backurl": "https://example.com/mod/oksigeniajepyso/view.php?id=7",
        "firstname": "Ana",
        "cansubmit": true
    }
}}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{lang}}">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
{{! The style hashes are those of the accessibility panel: its effects, its own sheet and its SVG filters. }}
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-hashes' 'sha256-S7ClRAmGJq3evHjIDEpITgQRsrKVzPiY8x2s1HkH4Kg=' 'sha256-4wOm3BwddL5VP97matJWlHbRkq9UhogcJWNPtIU220A=' 'sha256-HXpdsTS7aV+r+X2zQtxJcxGFkx9YDkRb2LwtnZjFr/E='; img-src 'self' data: blob:; media-src 'self' blob:; worker-src 'self' blob:; connect-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#e4e6e3" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#121517" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
<title>{{title}}</title>
<link rel="icon" href="{{base}}/iconos/icono.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{base}}/estilos.css?v={{version}}">
<script src="{{base}}/tema.js?v={{version}}"></script>
<script type="module" src="{{base}}/libs/oksigenia-access-panel/oksigenia-access-panel.js?v={{version}}"></script>
</head>
<body>
<main id="app" data-lengua="{{userlang}}" data-cm="{{cmid}}" data-rutina="{{code}}" data-sesskey="{{sesskey}}" data-servicio="{{service}}" data-volver="{{backurl}}" data-nombre="{{firstname}}" data-puede="{{#cansubmit}}1{{/cansubmit}}"></main>
<oksigenia-access-panel trigger="none" locale="{{lang}}" position="bottom-left" storage-key="jepyso" controls="line-height,letter-spacing,readable-font,dyslexia-font,contrast,highlight-links,colorblind,reading-guide,big-cursor,big-targets,pause-anim,focus"></oksigenia-access-panel>
<script type="module" src="{{base}}/app.js?v={{version}}"></script>
</body>
</html>
